WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:07.440
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.051
Hmmm...

00:00:13.051 --> 00:00:13.799
BLAH!

00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:18.325
Hmm. I guess I shouldn't
do that. I might need it.

00:00:18.325 --> 00:00:21.638
I mean, I might not. Things
could just calm down from here

00:00:21.638 --> 00:00:24.296
and--dammit, I can't do this optimism shit!

00:00:24.296 --> 00:00:27.808
I didn't become a scientist
by ignoring observed evidence.

00:00:27.808 --> 00:00:28.779
There's gotta be something--

00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:30.168
[underwater mumbling]

00:00:31.555 --> 00:00:33.493
Oh, is this a gate that opens?

00:00:33.493 --> 00:00:36.564
No! This is as solid as all hell!

00:00:37.535 --> 00:00:38.843
[underwater mumbling]

00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:42.616
What's even the point of this?

00:00:42.616 --> 00:00:43.089
There's no--

00:00:43.089 --> 00:00:44.663
[gurgling]

00:00:44.663 --> 00:00:45.749
There's not.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.521
[underwater "Ah!"]

00:00:48.521 --> 00:00:51.268
That's a tunnel! This could be what I--

00:00:51.268 --> 00:00:52.119
[gurgling]

00:00:53.349 --> 00:00:56.717
There's no current; what
does this turbine even...

00:00:56.717 --> 00:00:58.385
Oh no. Not again!

00:00:58.385 --> 00:01:00.525
Do I spin with it or get--

00:01:00.525 --> 00:01:02.574
Shit. Okay, uh...

00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:03.666
Clockwise...

00:01:03.666 --> 00:01:05.085
Or is it...

00:01:05.085 --> 00:01:05.916
No!

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:07.003
WUAH!

00:01:07.003 --> 00:01:10.310
[underwater mumbling]

00:01:14.528 --> 00:01:15.410
[underwater mumbling]

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:17.859
Air!

00:01:17.859 --> 00:01:21.155
That's great! Wasn't so sure
I was going to have that.

00:01:21.155 --> 00:01:22.412
Well...

00:01:22.412 --> 00:01:24.707
As far as hiding places go...

00:01:24.707 --> 00:01:26.399
...this is pretty good.

00:01:26.399 --> 00:01:28.980
But...it has other problems.

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:32.107
[underwater mumbling]

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.748
[underwater "Uh oh."]

00:01:37.138 --> 00:01:39.052
[underwater mumbling]

00:01:40.136 --> 00:01:44.539
Huh. That was better than a
lot of them. I didn't even die.

00:01:44.539 --> 00:01:47.329
This is not promising.

00:01:47.329 --> 00:01:49.233
This is a lot more promising.

00:01:49.233 --> 00:01:52.926
Could I have an actual hideout this time?

00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:54.877
I mean they're not going to
follow me through the water...

00:01:54.877 --> 00:01:56.299
Oh NO!

00:01:56.299 --> 00:01:57.472
AAAAAAAH!

00:01:57.472 --> 00:01:59.514
AAAAAAH! AAAH!

00:01:59.514 --> 00:02:04.763
[underwater screaming]

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:10.184
Get the fuck--AAAAAAAH! MY EYES!

00:02:10.184 --> 00:02:12.181
STOP IT STOP STOP!

00:02:12.181 --> 00:02:13.275
DEAD!

00:02:13.275 --> 00:02:14.427
NYAH!

00:02:14.427 --> 00:02:15.872
NYAAAH!

00:02:15.872 --> 00:02:17.694
AM I GOING TO SEE AGAIN?!

00:02:18.691 --> 00:02:22.153
Yeah... I can still see...

00:02:22.153 --> 00:02:23.641
...TODAY!

00:02:23.641 --> 00:02:25.405
I'm going to end up like Ted!

00:02:25.405 --> 00:02:29.336
He wore sunglasses all the time;
didn't matter what was happening.

00:02:29.336 --> 00:02:30.617
Be prepared?

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:34.044
He was also a chain-smoker,
but he did good work.

00:02:34.044 --> 00:02:34.868
Ted wasn't--

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:36.480
[machinegun fire]
Shit.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.676
YEAH! I'M NOT IMAGINING IT!
THEY CAME IN FROM THE SKY!

00:02:39.676 --> 00:02:41.412
THEY'RE FROM THE SKY!

00:02:41.412 --> 00:02:42.758
WELCOME TO THE GROUND!

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.320
[CP emergency beacon whistles]

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.719
[whistles]

00:02:47.719 --> 00:02:50.373
"If you'd like to make a call,
please die before dialing--"

00:02:50.373 --> 00:02:51.382
Whoa!

00:02:52.961 --> 00:02:56.987
Just because you can't move doesn't mean
you should sneak up on people like that!

00:02:56.987 --> 00:03:01.812
IF I WANT HELP SLOWLY RIPPING MY
OWN HEAD OFF, I'LL ASK FOR IT!

00:03:01.812 --> 00:03:02.892
Hey, isn't this--

00:03:02.892 --> 00:03:03.539
AH!

00:03:04.905 --> 00:03:06.339
AAAH!

00:03:06.339 --> 00:03:07.014
I can't...

00:03:07.785 --> 00:03:09.764
I'm running a little low here!

00:03:09.764 --> 00:03:11.631
Oh for crying out loud!

00:03:11.631 --> 00:03:13.137
Okay, switch the rounds.

00:03:13.137 --> 00:03:16.218
Oh, what the hell? This is a
different caliber for this gun!

00:03:16.218 --> 00:03:17.045
What...?

00:03:17.045 --> 00:03:18.233
[manhack whines]
Well, I'm almost spent;

00:03:18.233 --> 00:03:19.225
[manhack whines]
I don't have time for--

00:03:19.225 --> 00:03:20.170
[manhack whines]
Okay, FINE!

00:03:22.102 --> 00:03:25.098
Okay, now I can think for ONE SECOND!

00:03:25.098 --> 00:03:29.324
Dammit! At Black Mesa, all the pistols
and machine guns used the same ammo!

00:03:29.324 --> 00:03:31.102
What's wrong with these cops?

00:03:31.102 --> 00:03:33.510
They just have so much ammo,
they don't care.

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:34.833
Well, I care!

00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:37.002
And I've gone in circles again!

00:03:37.002 --> 00:03:39.729
What about the sky? Anyone still there?

00:03:39.729 --> 00:03:42.939
No wonder they're on my ass
if I'm going in circles!

00:03:42.939 --> 00:03:45.886
I missed the first day of fugitive class!

00:03:45.886 --> 00:03:49.939
But the thing is I've been following
the ONLY PATH in front of me!

00:03:50.888 --> 00:03:52.307
Nope!

00:03:52.307 --> 00:03:54.276
It's the damned canals!

00:03:54.276 --> 00:03:55.233
NGYAH!

00:03:55.233 --> 00:03:57.203
And Barney...!

00:03:57.203 --> 00:04:00.549
So I guess the first lesson
of being a fugitive is

00:04:00.549 --> 00:04:05.367
DON'T TAKE ADVICE FROM A FUCKING COP
ON HOW TO GET AWAY FROM THE COPS!

00:04:05.367 --> 00:04:06.367
BLAH!

00:04:06.367 --> 00:04:07.933
Ooh, that's hot...

00:04:07.933 --> 00:04:09.193
Jeez.

00:04:09.193 --> 00:04:11.330
It doesn't seem to bother the tongue thing.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.182
I'm still surprised they're
not from a swamp planet.

00:04:14.182 --> 00:04:17.369
I'm not even sure how to
describe where they're from.

00:04:17.369 --> 00:04:18.554
Flammable.

00:04:20.952 --> 00:04:22.798
Yep! He went for it!

00:04:22.798 --> 00:04:23.963
This is kind of tight...

00:04:24.487 --> 00:04:25.413
Ehh...

00:04:25.413 --> 00:04:27.741
Good enough. I'm covering my ears.

00:04:27.741 --> 00:04:28.564
[muffled explosion]

00:04:28.564 --> 00:04:29.881
OH!

00:04:29.881 --> 00:04:31.819
That's a rush!

00:04:31.819 --> 00:04:35.051
That'd be good at concerts: set
off explosives behind the stage

00:04:35.051 --> 00:04:37.555
at the peak of the song to
really bring the bass home.

00:04:37.555 --> 00:04:39.746
Bum-bum-bum-bum-poooorrrrfffshhh !

00:04:39.746 --> 00:04:42.713
Ah. This is not the fun corner.

00:04:42.713 --> 00:04:45.888
Yep. I'll leave the skull. I'm not greedy.

00:04:45.888 --> 00:04:47.877
Why is this venting so much?

00:04:47.877 --> 00:04:50.743
Is this preventing the city from blowing up?

00:04:50.743 --> 00:04:52.134
Hoo-ba-BA!

00:04:52.134 --> 00:04:53.444
AH! Ah...

00:04:53.444 --> 00:04:56.491
Now every time my face hurts,
I'm going to think of Kleiner.

00:04:56.491 --> 00:04:57.636
And no helmet.

00:04:59.321 --> 00:05:01.000
Yeah, straight lines.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.081
STRAIGHT LINES!

00:05:03.081 --> 00:05:03.823
Good.

00:05:03.823 --> 00:05:08.217
Why is this barred off? This metal
looks too new to be a dungeon.

00:05:08.217 --> 00:05:12.762
Ha! Lambda, huh? Maybe I'm
not the only street physicist.

00:05:12.762 --> 00:05:15.144
Okay, boarded off.
That's what I want to see.

00:05:15.144 --> 00:05:18.061
That means I'm the only
person...that comes down here.

00:05:19.803 --> 00:05:22.520
Really, I'd like it if I
could nail them back up, but--

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.642
Oh! Somebody stashed some ammo here.

00:05:25.642 --> 00:05:28.482
And themself, just to be safe.

00:05:28.482 --> 00:05:30.309
Fuck, uh...

00:05:30.309 --> 00:05:31.516
Okay, come on!

00:05:33.277 --> 00:05:34.529
Are you kidding me?

00:05:34.529 --> 00:05:38.908
Boy, I can see why they caged this off;
wouldn't want somebody to get bored.

00:05:38.908 --> 00:05:42.834
This IS a pretty sweet hiding spot
though I'm not sure that matters.

00:05:42.834 --> 00:05:45.635
It's those damned floating paparazzi bots.

00:05:45.635 --> 00:05:48.654
As soon as they found me, the
police were on me in seconds.

00:05:48.654 --> 00:05:50.473
Maybe that's why the cops are so dumb:

00:05:50.473 --> 00:05:53.473
They just get orders where to go
and shoot anything that moves.

00:05:53.473 --> 00:05:57.813
Oh here we go. This looks promising.
You could hide some bodies in here.

00:05:57.813 --> 00:05:59.468
Maybe that's why this is caged off.

00:05:59.468 --> 00:06:01.074
MIKE: Let's go! They've got tacos!

00:06:01.074 --> 00:06:02.417
DAVE: Tacos!

00:06:02.417 --> 00:06:04.199
Guess it's their lunch break.

00:06:04.199 --> 00:06:06.618
Well... Be prepared.

00:06:06.618 --> 00:06:08.598
These new rounds fit. That's great.

00:06:08.598 --> 00:06:12.492
Enjoy your tacos. I'll have
dessert here if you want some

00:06:12.492 --> 00:06:16.283
though I'm not sure I have enough
for everybody. I sure hope so.

00:06:17.171 --> 00:06:18.343
[underwater mumbling]

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:27.881
[underwater mumbling]

00:06:27.881 --> 00:06:29.767
I've been here!

00:06:29.767 --> 00:06:31.638
What was the point of any of this?!

00:06:31.638 --> 00:06:33.010
Secure the water...

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.971
Oh, shit! It's the taco truck!

00:06:35.784 --> 00:06:36.924
This again...

00:06:36.924 --> 00:06:37.987
It's on fire!

00:06:37.987 --> 00:06:39.349
AAAH! AAAH!

00:06:39.349 --> 00:06:41.786
OKAY, I GUESS I'D LIKE
SOME CHICKEN WITH LETTUCE!

00:06:41.786 --> 00:06:42.611
...TOMATOES!

00:06:43.594 --> 00:06:44.548
...ONIONS!

00:06:44.548 --> 00:06:46.962
UH, HARD SHELL, MEDIUM SALSA!

00:06:48.863 --> 00:06:51.393
DAMMIT, I SAID MEDIUM SALSA!
THIS IS TOO HOT!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.649
IT'S STILL TOO HOT! I'M CHANGING MY ORDER!

00:06:58.647 --> 00:06:59.813
DID YOU GET ALL THAT?!

00:07:01.293 --> 00:07:02.969
Okay, good.

00:07:02.969 --> 00:07:05.386
Dammit. More's going on
than what I'm seeing here.

00:07:05.386 --> 00:07:08.819
They were completely ready for
me with their barrels of fun,

00:07:08.819 --> 00:07:11.501
but then they jumped
into the trench with me.

00:07:11.501 --> 00:07:12.040
Yeah...

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:16.037
Why would they give up their
tactical advantage that they set up?

00:07:16.037 --> 00:07:17.434
That doesn't...

00:07:17.434 --> 00:07:20.983
The cops gunning for me are
NOT the same ones tracking me.

00:07:20.983 --> 00:07:23.354
The intelligence divide is too big.

00:07:23.354 --> 00:07:26.494
Once again, your kind adds
nothing to the discussion.

00:07:26.494 --> 00:07:28.354
[manhack whines]
And don't even get me started on you.

00:07:29.707 --> 00:07:32.500
That's really the problem,
though. These fucking bots!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:35.828
Maybe not the saw-blade ones
but for sure the flash-bangers.

00:07:35.828 --> 00:07:37.700
They've gotta stop tracking me.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.833
Ah! Okay...

00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:40.367
Yeah...

00:07:41.638 --> 00:07:44.108
I don't think these have trackers on them.

00:07:45.445 --> 00:07:45.945
They...

00:07:46.468 --> 00:07:47.694
They're too dumb.

00:07:49.763 --> 00:07:53.509
The data would be too noisy. They would
track every moving object in the city.

00:07:53.509 --> 00:07:55.097
Ah, I think that's it.

00:07:55.097 --> 00:07:57.476
The flash-bangers transmit my location,

00:07:57.476 --> 00:07:59.301
that's read by a computer,

00:07:59.301 --> 00:08:00.757
which predicts my route,

00:08:00.757 --> 00:08:04.620
which sends orders to the cops, who
have trouble not shooting themselves,

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:09.601
and that's it. There's no human
oversight at all! It's all on auto-pilot!

00:08:09.601 --> 00:08:12.117
Wait, what the hell? Is this a dead end?

00:08:12.117 --> 00:08:16.302
Then why have all the fencing and the
bars just to protect a bunch of rubble...?

00:08:16.302 --> 00:08:19.916
I've got to be missing something. There
were five saw-bots trying to kill me and--

00:08:19.916 --> 00:08:21.572
No, NO! I'm sick of this!

00:08:21.572 --> 00:08:25.189
I'm going to bust open that pipe and
we're going to find some answers together,

00:08:25.189 --> 00:08:26.911
because I'm not going back to the--

00:08:26.911 --> 00:08:29.953
Oh wait. Shit. Air vent. Okay.

00:08:29.953 --> 00:08:32.124
If this loops back, I'm
going to murder someone,

00:08:32.124 --> 00:08:34.084
but I guess I've already done that.

00:08:35.218 --> 00:08:38.999
Well, I feel like I'm learning
more. It's all automated.

00:08:38.999 --> 00:08:44.164
It feels like the entire world is conspiring
against me because it actually is!

00:08:45.821 --> 00:08:46.588
Though technically--

00:08:46.588 --> 00:08:50.116
[screaming]

00:08:50.116 --> 00:08:52.372
I forgot what I was thinking about.

00:08:52.372 --> 00:08:53.430
Something...

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:53.953
[manhacks whine]
Shit.

00:08:54.967 --> 00:08:56.063
That's too many!

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.336
That's too many!

00:08:57.836 --> 00:08:58.900
Okay...no!

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:00.300
That's...

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:00.870
Wah!

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:01.479
Dammit.

00:09:02.438 --> 00:09:03.945
Okay, no, no...

00:09:03.945 --> 00:09:04.988
You're getting me dizzy!

00:09:05.591 --> 00:09:06.765
Stop...!

00:09:06.765 --> 00:09:07.313
Fuck...

00:09:08.281 --> 00:09:09.767
BLAAH!

00:09:09.767 --> 00:09:10.533
GET 'EM OFF!

00:09:10.533 --> 00:09:13.198
JESUS CHRIST, THAT'S CLOSE!

00:09:13.198 --> 00:09:16.314
[screaming]

00:09:16.314 --> 00:09:19.200
[jabbering]

00:09:20.733 --> 00:09:21.885
What the fuck?

00:09:21.885 --> 00:09:23.397
[manhack whines]
Oh my god!

00:09:25.453 --> 00:09:30.089
Okay, I guess those ARE dangerous
when there's...a million of them.

00:09:30.089 --> 00:09:35.571
But that's true of anything. A Nerf bat'll
kill you if it's shoved down your esophagus!

00:09:35.571 --> 00:09:37.062
Manhacks...

00:09:37.062 --> 00:09:39.167
They don't care which man they hack up?

00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:42.095
I guess not! That's what
I was saying earlier!

00:09:42.095 --> 00:09:44.557
Jeez, that's a lot of fuel barrels.

00:09:44.557 --> 00:09:47.039
Good thing we had a firefight in here!

00:09:47.039 --> 00:09:48.263
Grr...

00:09:48.263 --> 00:09:51.902
But yeah. That's the logic trap
I was slipping into a little bit.

00:09:51.902 --> 00:09:55.535
There IS a conspiracy of
the whole world against me,

00:09:55.535 --> 00:09:56.964
but is it JUST me?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:01.764
Because most people think--yeah,
great place for the pipe here.

00:10:01.764 --> 00:10:03.800
Oh what? This is caged off?!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.533
This is so pointless!

00:10:05.533 --> 00:10:09.633
Okay, I don't feel like going into
monkey mode just yet. I'm sore.

00:10:09.633 --> 00:10:13.633
But yeah, most people who think the world
is out to get them aren't that important;

00:10:13.633 --> 00:10:16.993
it's just out to get
everybody and they're...there.

00:10:16.993 --> 00:10:20.733
But I AM that important, so how do I know?

00:10:20.733 --> 00:10:26.178
People think it's great being me and...it
is, but I have problems they don't.

00:10:26.178 --> 00:10:27.933
Well, the ones that aren't dead.

00:10:27.933 --> 00:10:30.933
Okay, how is anyone even
supposed to get in here?

00:10:32.065 --> 00:10:34.231
There's nothing up here. Why even...?

00:10:34.231 --> 00:10:36.333
Okay, it must come in
through the bottom here.

00:10:36.333 --> 00:10:39.212
I'd call this bad design but I
don't know what this room is.

00:10:41.537 --> 00:10:43.538
Okay, what the fuck?

00:10:43.538 --> 00:10:44.662
How am I supposed to...?

00:10:46.539 --> 00:10:49.152
I can't reach this. The walls are wet...

00:10:49.152 --> 00:10:51.303
All right! Monkey mode it is!

00:10:51.303 --> 00:10:52.054
Ook-ACK!

00:10:52.054 --> 00:10:57.324
Well I'll say this: In all my time in
the drain here, I haven't seen one rat.

00:10:57.324 --> 00:11:00.518
Maybe the manhacks aren't meant
to kill people specifically,

00:11:00.518 --> 00:11:02.378
but are just there to kill anything,

00:11:02.378 --> 00:11:05.400
so we let them loose in the
city to see what happens.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:08.541
I haven't seen any dogs or cats either.

00:11:10.623 --> 00:11:13.014
This is a pain in the ass with this armor.

00:11:13.014 --> 00:11:17.289
So yeah. It looks like Ninja Turtles had
it right. Wouldn't have guessed that.

00:11:17.289 --> 00:11:21.116
We have MOUSERS. They're just
flying and don't look as cool.

00:11:21.116 --> 00:11:23.083
I'd actually be kind of honored if...

00:11:23.083 --> 00:11:25.186
No, not by you.

00:11:25.186 --> 00:11:25.822
Okay...

00:11:28.384 --> 00:11:32.014
Why is this barred off?
It looks like solid steel.

00:11:32.014 --> 00:11:35.966
Oh, what? Is the entrance at
the bottom? Yeah, probably.

00:11:35.966 --> 00:11:37.213
[growls]

00:11:37.213 --> 00:11:41.466
Well, I think MOUSERS were the only
thing Ninja Turtles was right about.

00:11:41.466 --> 00:11:44.014
And Dimension X, sort of.

00:11:44.014 --> 00:11:45.511
And of course ninjas.

00:11:47.461 --> 00:11:53.017
But no mutants, no robotic foot
soldiers. That's what makes this reality.

00:11:54.162 --> 00:11:56.646
[underwater mumbling]

00:11:56.646 --> 00:11:58.357
[underwater "What the hell?"]

00:11:58.357 --> 00:12:02.392
Okay, that looks welded shut, so
what the hell is going on here?!

00:12:02.392 --> 00:12:03.149
Come on...

00:12:04.441 --> 00:12:09.553
What is this place?! It's a fucking
Mario pipe maze in a flooded chamber

00:12:09.553 --> 00:12:14.533
right next to a fuel depot, and
it's ALL CAGED OFF, because...

00:12:18.225 --> 00:12:21.603
I bet the police right now
know exactly where I am

00:12:21.603 --> 00:12:23.902
but they can't figure out
how to get here either.

00:12:23.902 --> 00:12:28.087
Okay, THAT looks like an exit. THAT
looks normal, so let's start from there.

00:12:28.087 --> 00:12:31.869
These bars are blocking the view. I'm
going to get a better look from over here.

00:12:31.869 --> 00:12:33.024
Yeah, this is better.

00:12:33.024 --> 00:12:36.709
Okay, yeah, there's that tunnel.
So that's how I get over there.

00:12:36.709 --> 00:12:40.282
Never mind the fact that I can't get
into the tunnel because it's too high up.

00:12:40.282 --> 00:12:43.196
Am I missing something?
Was there another ladder?

00:12:43.196 --> 00:12:46.134
No! It's all covered in a steel
mesh! How am I supposed to...?

00:12:46.134 --> 00:12:49.625
Okay, wait wait. Wait.
There's a ladder there...

00:12:49.625 --> 00:12:51.316
So if I get through the tunnel...

00:12:51.316 --> 00:12:53.367
Jeez, almost fell off...

00:12:53.367 --> 00:12:58.608
I come up the ladder...but that's on
THIS side. How do I get on THAT side?

00:12:58.608 --> 00:13:01.443
Maybe I could lunge towards the edge but...

00:13:01.443 --> 00:13:04.617
I can't make that jump directly!

00:13:04.617 --> 00:13:05.820
N..dah!

00:13:10.071 --> 00:13:12.190
Maybe this was a mistake...

